<title>CANADA: Caldeonia chairman retires.</title>
<headline>Caldeonia chairman retires.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caledonia Mining Corp said on Tuesday that D.S. Macleod is retiring as chairman of the company's board and a director of the corporation to pursue other personal interests.</p>
<p>His retirement is effective at the end of January, the comapny said in a statement.</p>
<p>Stefan Hayden of Johannesburg, South Africa, currently vice-chairman, will become chairman.</p>
<p>Edmund Merringer of Toronto, currently secretary and a director, will become vice-chairman.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
